      "title": "Discovering Cryptographic Weaknesses with Claude",
      "url": "https://www.anthropic.com/research/discovering-cryptographic-weaknesses",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49087091",
      "score": 222,
      "comments": 169,
      "author": "gslin",
      "published": "2026-07-28T17:22:16Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Anthropic's Claude models demonstrate advanced cryptanalysis capabilities, identifying complex implementation flaws, weak primitives, and side-channel vulnerabilities in codebases.",
        "Prompting LLMs with cryptographic source code enables rapid detection of subtle logic errors, improper padding, and weak PRNG seeding.",
        "Security teams can integrate AI-driven code reviews into CI/CD pipelines to automate cryptographic audit workflows and remediate vulnerabilities early."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
