        "Flaws stem from broken authorization controls in central fleet management APIs, granting unauthorized access to cross-tenant organization accounts and vehicles.",
        "Connected vehicle systems require strict API-level access controls, robust multi-tenancy isolation, and hardware-enforced CAN bus safety boundaries to prevent remote manipulation."
      ]
